WEBVTT

00:00:03.070 --> 00:00:06.610
So this is the air bike from Ms. Clarice.

00:00:06.610 --> 00:00:10.410
It's far more advanced than the one 
you rode at the academy festival.

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:12.360
I've named it "Schwert."

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:14.620
I'm the one who owns it.

00:00:14.620 --> 00:00:17.620
So, what does "Schwert" mean?

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:19.910
It means "sword."

00:00:19.910 --> 00:00:21.750
Hey, I like it!

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:25.500
It's metallic and pointy, 
so that's a perfect name for it!

00:00:26.190 --> 00:00:29.260
Now, let's get modding.

00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:38.430
<b>Trapped in</b>

00:00:38.430 --> 00:00:40.770
<b>a Dating Sim</b>

00:00:40.770 --> 00:00:45.400
<b>Trapped in
a Dating Sim</b>

00:02:02.500 --> 00:02:04.470
Have you tried being happier about it?

00:02:04.470 --> 00:02:07.350
Yeah, you've been promoted.

00:02:07.580 --> 00:02:10.600
I didn't want to get promoted.

00:02:10.910 --> 00:02:13.960
But you won't have any 
trouble finding a wife now.

00:02:13.960 --> 00:02:16.490
See? The girls are looking at you.

00:02:17.050 --> 00:02:18.910
I heard he got promoted again.

00:02:18.910 --> 00:02:20.350
He could be a winning ticket now.

00:02:20.350 --> 00:02:23.120
Personally, I hate him, though.

00:02:23.120 --> 00:02:26.540
They're practically admitting that 
they're only after my status!

00:02:26.540 --> 00:02:27.960
No freakin' way!

00:02:27.960 --> 00:02:29.610
I can't deny that.

00:02:29.610 --> 00:02:33.130
Well, you might be able to develop 
a relationship with someone.

00:02:33.130 --> 00:02:34.380
The school trip's coming up.

00:02:35.320 --> 00:02:37.130
<i>The school trip event...</i>

00:02:37.940 --> 00:02:40.510
<i>Every year, all three grades 
go on a trip together.</i>

00:02:40.510 --> 00:02:42.760
<i>The students are split into three groups.</i>

00:02:43.100 --> 00:02:46.530
<i>In the game, you head to the same 
destination as your romantic interest,</i>

00:02:46.530 --> 00:02:48.630
<i>where you get to improve 
your relationship score.</i>

00:02:48.940 --> 00:02:51.900
<i>There are also items that can only 
be acquired at your destination,</i>

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:54.200
<i>so I decided to head to the 
southern floating island</i>

00:02:54.200 --> 00:02:56.330
<i>where the item I want can be found.</i>

00:02:57.150 --> 00:02:59.130
I guess we're going our separate ways.

00:02:59.130 --> 00:03:02.230
You'll be with Ms. Angelica 
and Ms. Olivia, right?

00:03:02.870 --> 00:03:04.990
Why don't you apologize 
and make up with them?

00:03:04.990 --> 00:03:07.160
What? Why would I apologize to them?

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:09.410
Because it's bound to be your fault.

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:10.660
Totally.

00:03:10.660 --> 00:03:12.210
Yup, yup.

00:03:12.210 --> 00:03:15.670
Exactly what kind of person 
do you guys think I am?

00:03:16.190 --> 00:03:22.200
Unlike You Wannabe Nobles

00:03:21.190 --> 00:03:24.570
This is nothing like the school 
trips I'm familiar with.

00:03:24.570 --> 00:03:26.680
This is a luxury passenger ship, after all.

00:03:26.680 --> 00:03:29.810
Apparently, you'll even get to enjoy 
water skiing at your destination.

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:33.900
I know. I'm planning to take Schwert 
for a test drive while I'm there.

00:03:34.490 --> 00:03:36.190
Anyway...

00:03:42.950 --> 00:03:45.760
We'll have such a marvelous 
time once we arrive.

00:03:45.760 --> 00:03:49.150
I'll tell you all about my 
forefathers' heroic exploits.

00:03:50.960 --> 00:03:52.350
Ms. Deirdre!

00:03:52.350 --> 00:03:53.680
I'm looking forward to it!

00:03:53.680 --> 00:03:56.760
<i>If I want to get married, I'll have 
to put in some effort while I'm here.</i>

00:03:58.290 --> 00:03:59.080
Mr. Chris!

00:03:59.080 --> 00:03:59.860
Mr. Chris!

00:03:59.860 --> 00:04:00.910
Where are you heading next?

00:04:00.910 --> 00:04:01.930
Come eat with me.

00:04:01.930 --> 00:04:03.400
Join me on the pool deck.

00:04:05.190 --> 00:04:07.130
Mr. Chris!

00:04:05.480 --> 00:04:08.850
<i>The handsome romantic interests are 
getting as much attention as ever.</i>

00:04:08.850 --> 00:04:12.670
<i>I wish they'd follow the game's story and 
get together with Ms. Olivia already.</i>

00:04:17.610 --> 00:04:20.820
<i>Not that it's any of my business.</i>

00:04:22.980 --> 00:04:25.360
I've chosen to forsake the duke's family.

00:04:25.590 --> 00:04:29.640
Me, too. They're on their way out since her 
engagement to the prince was called off.

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:33.930
We're supposed to pull the 
string and throw it out a window?

00:04:33.930 --> 00:04:36.170
Yeah. They said not to attract any attention.

00:04:53.780 --> 00:04:55.500
<i>It's like a dream.</i>

00:04:57.020 --> 00:05:01.310
<i>If only the three of us could stroll 
through this beautiful place together...</i>

00:05:07.950 --> 00:05:12.490
<i>Is it even all right for me 
to remain at the academy?</i>

00:05:41.730 --> 00:05:43.940
You must be students from the academy.

00:05:44.290 --> 00:05:45.670
Are you here to visit the shrine?

00:05:45.670 --> 00:05:47.070
Actually, uh...

00:05:47.070 --> 00:05:49.670
This shrine is dedicated to marriage.

00:05:49.670 --> 00:05:51.830
It's said to be very effective.

00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:52.880
What?

00:05:52.880 --> 00:05:54.330
Marriage?

00:05:54.850 --> 00:05:57.080
<i>So this is the event where the protagonist</i>

00:05:57.080 --> 00:05:59.320
<i>and romantic interest 
visit the shrine together.</i>

00:05:59.730 --> 00:06:01.160
Yup, yup.

00:06:01.160 --> 00:06:03.340
We should start by making an offering.

00:06:05.840 --> 00:06:07.590
Y-You're giving them that much?

00:06:07.890 --> 00:06:09.360
Is this not correct?

00:06:09.360 --> 00:06:12.600
At the temple, it's normal 
to donate about this much.

00:06:16.220 --> 00:06:18.730
God, please help me find a wife.

00:06:19.230 --> 00:06:22.690
Find me a kind woman with common sense!

00:06:22.690 --> 00:06:26.190
I'm into mature, sexy 
women who will coddle me!

00:06:26.190 --> 00:06:28.490
And if she's a little naughty, even better!

00:06:28.490 --> 00:06:31.990
Ow, ow, ow!

00:06:28.730 --> 00:06:31.990
Don't say things like that 
in a holy place, you fool!

00:06:31.990 --> 00:06:33.990
Ha, ha, ha.

00:06:40.020 --> 00:06:44.790
<i>I wonder if Ms. Angelica hopes to marry 
someone more respectable than the prince.</i>

00:06:46.180 --> 00:06:50.020
<i>For Ms. Olivia, someone other than the 
disappointing Greg and Brad could be—</i>

00:06:50.460 --> 00:06:53.760
<i>No, I guess Julius and 
Jilk are hopeless, too.</i>

00:06:54.840 --> 00:06:57.020
<i>No, that's not right.</i>

00:06:57.700 --> 00:07:01.520
<i>As long as he makes Ms. Olivia 
happy, anyone will do.</i>

00:07:04.660 --> 00:07:09.030
Academy students, these are 
our shrine's famous charms.

00:07:09.450 --> 00:07:11.030
Take one as a souvenir.

00:07:11.290 --> 00:07:12.780
Charms?

00:07:16.890 --> 00:07:20.290
<i>That's right! This is what I was looking for!</i>

00:07:20.570 --> 00:07:22.690
<i>The randomly acquired "Good Luck Charm,"</i>

00:07:22.690 --> 00:07:26.680
<i>"War Fortune Charm," and 
"Blessing of Element" talismans!</i>

00:07:27.550 --> 00:07:31.150
<i>I wanted these items so badly, 
I pulled some strings to make sure</i>

00:07:31.150 --> 00:07:34.550
<i>I'd end up at the southern floating 
island on the school trip.</i>

00:07:31.910 --> 00:07:34.550
Thank you, thank you, thank you.

00:07:35.660 --> 00:07:37.870
Bless you, school trip event!

00:07:37.870 --> 00:07:41.430
U-Um, those are for the three of you.

00:07:42.440 --> 00:07:44.750
Oh, we don't need them.

00:07:44.750 --> 00:07:46.190
You keep them, Mr. Leon.

00:07:47.230 --> 00:07:49.480
No, you might as well take one.

00:07:49.480 --> 00:07:51.330
Let's open them together.

00:07:51.330 --> 00:07:52.440
Leon...

00:07:55.780 --> 00:07:57.320
If you insist.

00:07:57.320 --> 00:07:58.690
Thank you.

00:07:59.450 --> 00:08:02.560
Here we go. Come on, big money.

00:08:02.560 --> 00:08:04.110
There are no winners or losers!

00:08:04.110 --> 00:08:05.710
There are just different varieties!

00:08:06.040 --> 00:08:06.960
Ready, and...

00:08:09.090 --> 00:08:10.170
What is this?

00:08:10.170 --> 00:08:11.470
It's beautiful.

00:08:12.250 --> 00:08:15.470
Red and white Blessing of 
Element talismans, huh?

00:08:15.850 --> 00:08:18.050
I'm glad you two got those.

00:08:18.050 --> 00:08:20.760
I've got no affinity for 
those colored elements.

00:08:20.760 --> 00:08:21.790
Affinity?

00:08:21.790 --> 00:08:23.100
What does that mean?

00:08:23.330 --> 00:08:26.100
In any case, you keep those.

00:08:26.320 --> 00:08:29.110
I got something good, too.

00:08:29.410 --> 00:08:31.400
It's different from ours.

00:08:31.400 --> 00:08:33.640
Are those swords?

00:08:33.640 --> 00:08:36.110
Yeah, it's a War Fortune Charm.

00:08:36.570 --> 00:08:39.260
<i>It's an item that enhances</i>

00:08:39.260 --> 00:08:43.190
<i>close-quarters combat abilities 
and increases physical attributes.</i>

00:08:43.190 --> 00:08:46.750
It's shaped a little differently from 
the one I'm familiar with, though.

00:08:47.210 --> 00:08:48.940
Are the charms to your liking?

00:08:48.940 --> 00:08:50.750
Yes, thank you.

00:08:51.180 --> 00:08:54.260
Thank you for visiting the shrine.

00:08:54.590 --> 00:08:58.260
The three of you must have 
prayed for your friendship.

00:08:58.260 --> 00:08:59.090
Huh?

00:09:06.440 --> 00:09:10.770
Master, did you not head into the 
dungeon to get the Holy Bracelet

00:09:11.150 --> 00:09:14.430
because you hadn't acquired 
that talisman yet?

00:09:15.530 --> 00:09:19.130
I thought it was odd that you weren't 
in more of a hurry with Marie around.

00:09:19.450 --> 00:09:23.160
Is she not attempting to take 
the protagonist's place?

00:09:23.490 --> 00:09:29.170
As long as she's played the game 
thoroughly, she won't do anything stupid.

00:09:29.850 --> 00:09:33.530
We're screwed if we head down the war route.

00:09:39.310 --> 00:09:40.620
It's nearly time.

00:09:44.310 --> 00:09:45.340
Bartfort.

00:09:46.630 --> 00:09:48.870
I heard you fought Brad.

00:09:48.870 --> 00:09:52.070
You and I should have our own sword fight.

00:09:52.070 --> 00:09:56.210
But Brad challenged me to 
a fight he's not good at.

00:09:56.210 --> 00:09:59.200
You want to sword fight me when 
you're a skilled swordsman?

00:10:00.130 --> 00:10:03.510
I've never thought of myself 
as a skilled swordsman.

00:10:04.060 --> 00:10:06.460
My father says I have no talent for it.

00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:10.120
Then why don't you get Marie to console you?

00:10:10.120 --> 00:10:11.960
You know nothing about me!

00:10:12.400 --> 00:10:14.960
You've never worked a day in your life!

00:10:17.980 --> 00:10:18.670
What's going on?

00:10:18.670 --> 00:10:19.220
An alarm?

00:10:28.150 --> 00:10:29.830
You're kidding.

00:10:29.830 --> 00:10:30.920
What's happening?

00:10:30.920 --> 00:10:32.140
A monsters?

00:10:30.920 --> 00:10:33.230
Calm down, everyone! Head inside the ship!

00:10:32.140 --> 00:10:33.820
What's going on?

00:10:33.820 --> 00:10:35.300
That mark...

00:10:35.300 --> 00:10:37.490
That's the crest of the Fanoss Dukedom.

00:10:38.810 --> 00:10:40.650
<i>The Fanoss Dukedom...</i>

00:10:40.650 --> 00:10:43.270
<i>Originally belonging to 
a duke of the kingdom,</i>

00:10:43.270 --> 00:10:45.830
<i>they declared their independence 
and now call themselves a nation.</i>

00:10:46.590 --> 00:10:50.750
<i>They're not supposed to show 
up until the end of the game.</i>

00:10:50.980 --> 00:10:54.000
<i>Why? It's too soon.</i>

00:10:54.280 --> 00:10:56.930
I'll instruct the main ship 
and the <i>Partner</i> to attack.

00:10:56.930 --> 00:10:58.260
Just give the word, Master.

00:10:58.260 --> 00:11:00.050
Send them immediately. 
How much time do we have?

00:11:07.420 --> 00:11:09.270
A monster airship?

00:11:09.630 --> 00:11:11.200
It's the princess.

00:11:11.200 --> 00:11:12.020
Leon!

00:11:12.020 --> 00:11:13.730
Why is the dukedom attacking?

00:11:17.130 --> 00:11:19.030
Princess Hertrude...

00:11:19.290 --> 00:11:20.310
You know her?

00:11:20.310 --> 00:11:23.610
Yes, I met her once before.

00:11:27.090 --> 00:11:33.890
I, first princess of the Fanoss Dukedom, 
Hertrude Sera Fanoss, have a message for you.

00:11:35.040 --> 00:11:39.250
We have declared war on the Holfort Kingdom.

00:11:40.300 --> 00:11:46.350
Children of the kingdom's foolish 
nobles, surrender or die.

00:11:46.350 --> 00:11:48.850
I shall grant you time to make your decision.

00:11:49.460 --> 00:11:51.380
I'll wait one hour.

00:11:52.170 --> 00:11:54.150
A d-declaration of war?

00:11:54.550 --> 00:11:57.070
Is she trying to take us hostage?

00:11:57.370 --> 00:12:01.000
<i>Why is this third-year event happening now?</i>

00:12:02.540 --> 00:12:04.520
<i>Where did I go wrong?</i>

00:12:13.330 --> 00:12:16.190
How do you do, people of the kingdom?

00:12:16.190 --> 00:12:18.610
My name is Garrett.

00:12:18.610 --> 00:12:19.840
Now, then...

00:12:19.840 --> 00:12:24.250
Children of nobles ranking as barons 
or higher will be taken prisoner.

00:12:24.250 --> 00:12:27.170
We have no interest in anyone 
ranked lower than that.

00:12:27.170 --> 00:12:30.280
We have no need for demi-human 
slaves or the ship's crew, either.

00:12:30.280 --> 00:12:30.650
What?

00:12:30.650 --> 00:12:32.480
They're not interested in knights?

00:12:32.480 --> 00:12:33.090
But...

00:12:32.740 --> 00:12:33.770
<i>This isn't good.</i>

00:12:33.090 --> 00:12:34.890
We're not even worth anything as hostages?

00:12:33.770 --> 00:12:36.270
<i>What should I do? How can 
I get us out of this?</i>

00:12:34.890 --> 00:12:36.270
But my favorites...

00:12:39.470 --> 00:12:41.740
I am Angelica Rapha Redgrave.

00:12:42.450 --> 00:12:45.110
I believe you're at least 
familiar with my family's name.

00:12:45.110 --> 00:12:46.620
Well, well.

00:12:46.890 --> 00:12:51.120
I'm the only hostage you need.
 Let the others go.

00:12:51.120 --> 00:12:54.870
I wasn't expecting a duke's 
daughter to be aboard this ship.

00:12:54.870 --> 00:12:58.660
I applaud your courage to step forward.

00:12:58.660 --> 00:12:59.960
This way, please.

00:13:00.510 --> 00:13:02.260
A-Angie!

00:13:02.260 --> 00:13:03.260
Hey, wait!

00:13:06.050 --> 00:13:07.870
You idiot! Don't do anything stupid!

00:13:07.870 --> 00:13:09.220
Nobody made her say it!

00:13:09.220 --> 00:13:11.630
Let go! Are you guys insane?

00:13:11.630 --> 00:13:16.020
Ah, he cares so deeply about his friend.

00:13:18.280 --> 00:13:19.270
Leon...

00:13:23.650 --> 00:13:28.660
Let's give these nobles one last job.

00:13:29.030 --> 00:13:31.910
I want you to punish him.

00:13:33.620 --> 00:13:34.920
Come on, hurry up!

00:13:35.770 --> 00:13:37.220
No hard feelings.

00:13:43.670 --> 00:13:44.670
Mr. Leon!

00:13:45.420 --> 00:13:46.930
Stop! Don't do this!

00:13:47.320 --> 00:13:51.810
That's not how you ask 
someone to do something.

00:13:51.810 --> 00:13:56.060
That's hardly fitting behavior 
for a duke's daughter.

00:13:58.080 --> 00:14:00.360
P-Please stop.

00:14:01.630 --> 00:14:03.160
I'm begging you.

00:14:06.220 --> 00:14:09.450
Too bad! I reject your request!

00:14:14.420 --> 00:14:16.960
Now, come this way.

00:14:17.240 --> 00:14:20.960
Or do you want to expose 
all the students to danger?

00:14:25.460 --> 00:14:26.590
Wait!

00:14:26.970 --> 00:14:28.680
Don't go, Angie!

00:14:29.090 --> 00:14:30.280
Don't you dare.

00:14:30.280 --> 00:14:32.480
You know what'll happen if you do, don't you?

00:14:32.480 --> 00:14:35.030
Don't touch her, you shitheads!

00:14:32.900 --> 00:14:33.980
Stay out of this.

00:14:35.030 --> 00:14:36.030
Stop!

00:14:36.030 --> 00:14:38.560
You won't get away with this!

00:14:37.230 --> 00:14:38.560
Shut up!

00:14:43.290 --> 00:14:46.280
It's good to see you again, Angelica.

00:14:46.580 --> 00:14:49.280
I never thought we'd be reunited like this.

00:14:49.520 --> 00:14:51.850
Do you really intend to go to war?

00:14:52.330 --> 00:14:55.410
You know how much stronger the 
kingdom is than your dukedom.

00:14:55.410 --> 00:14:59.920
You're right. It's true that overcoming that 
difference in power would be difficult.

00:15:00.770 --> 00:15:02.420
But behold.

00:15:02.420 --> 00:15:05.450
Your Highness, we should 
discuss the hostages first.

00:15:05.450 --> 00:15:07.170
Ah, that's right.

00:15:07.880 --> 00:15:11.430
What are you talking about? I surrendered 
myself so you'd let the others go.

00:15:11.430 --> 00:15:15.670
Only two students resisted 
when you were taken away.

00:15:15.670 --> 00:15:18.420
How cold and spineless they are.

00:15:18.420 --> 00:15:21.010
They're not fit to be nobles.

00:15:29.890 --> 00:15:31.700
Come on, don't cry.

00:15:32.210 --> 00:15:34.570
I failed to save Angie.

00:15:35.110 --> 00:15:38.200
I can't get you out of here, either.

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:41.020
<i>I can't handle crying girls.</i>

00:15:41.630 --> 00:15:47.490
<i>But maybe the ability to shed tears 
for another is an impressive thing.</i>

00:15:51.230 --> 00:15:52.450
Mr. Chris...

00:15:52.450 --> 00:15:56.100
Bartfort, an envoy from 
the dukedom just arrived.

00:15:56.570 --> 00:15:57.540
And?

00:15:57.970 --> 00:16:00.600
Angelica is the only 
hostage they'll be taking.

00:16:00.870 --> 00:16:03.350
They'll begin the attack in an hour.

00:16:03.350 --> 00:16:06.700
We're to die like nobles, apparently.

00:16:07.650 --> 00:16:09.360
Figures.

00:16:09.670 --> 00:16:11.970
This ship has six Armors.

00:16:11.970 --> 00:16:16.090
I want us to buy time for 
the others to escape.

00:16:16.090 --> 00:16:17.390
I need your help.

00:16:17.390 --> 00:16:21.370
No way. They turned their backs on Angie.

00:16:22.120 --> 00:16:23.690
Let them all fall.

00:16:25.290 --> 00:16:27.380
Leon Fou Bartfort.

00:16:28.700 --> 00:16:30.380
Please save us.

00:16:30.380 --> 00:16:31.880
No.

00:16:34.410 --> 00:16:35.500
Sorry to have bothered you.

00:16:36.940 --> 00:16:40.230
You idiot. I wasn't done talking.

00:16:42.020 --> 00:16:45.880
I'm not so kind as to help 
people who don't do anything.

00:16:48.260 --> 00:16:51.020
If we're doing this, we're <i>all</i> doing this.

00:16:54.140 --> 00:16:56.160
Guys, listen to me.

00:16:56.510 --> 00:17:00.160
I understand why you lost your nerve 
in the face of so many enemies.

00:17:00.640 --> 00:17:03.910
But for all of us to survive, we have to fight.

00:17:03.910 --> 00:17:05.700
Please help!

00:17:06.740 --> 00:17:09.880
If we don't stand up to them 
now, we'll die like dogs.

00:17:09.880 --> 00:17:10.670
Shut up!

00:17:10.670 --> 00:17:12.060
First-year brat!

00:17:12.060 --> 00:17:12.920
Don't get ahead of yourself!

00:17:12.920 --> 00:17:14.560
Sit down! You've been disinherited!

00:17:14.560 --> 00:17:16.260
We can't beat them!

00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:17.820
This is all Angelica's fault!

00:17:17.820 --> 00:17:19.880
All she did was save her own skin!

00:17:19.880 --> 00:17:22.180
What a pathetic excuse for a duke's daughter!

00:17:24.590 --> 00:17:27.850
Quit your whining, scumbags.

00:17:29.350 --> 00:17:30.860
Listen to me.

00:17:31.180 --> 00:17:35.860
I'm a knight with an official barony 
and lower fifth rank to boot.

00:17:36.290 --> 00:17:39.120
I have more status than the 
instructors who lead us.

00:17:39.610 --> 00:17:41.820
And I'm ordering you to fight.

00:17:42.370 --> 00:17:47.370
Die fighting. It's better than being killed.

00:17:47.370 --> 00:17:48.130
What?!

00:17:48.130 --> 00:17:48.820
You can't be serious!

00:17:48.820 --> 00:17:49.890
I don't want to die!

00:17:49.890 --> 00:17:51.860
<i>You</i> can go fight!

00:17:51.860 --> 00:17:55.880
Oh, you bet I'll fight. 
After all, I'm a real noble.

00:17:55.880 --> 00:17:58.890
Unlike you wannabe nobles.

00:17:59.220 --> 00:18:00.350
What?

00:18:00.890 --> 00:18:03.640
Wannabe nobles, you say?

00:18:05.340 --> 00:18:08.770
How dare you? I'm a count's daughter.

00:18:08.770 --> 00:18:10.520
Take it back.

00:18:10.520 --> 00:18:12.270
Huh? Who are you?

00:18:12.500 --> 00:18:15.620
I am Deirdre Fou Roseblade.

00:18:15.620 --> 00:18:18.140
I'm the daughter of Count Roseblade.

00:18:18.140 --> 00:18:19.650
Don't you forget it.

00:18:19.650 --> 00:18:21.360
Roseblade...

00:18:21.360 --> 00:18:26.130
Excluding the duke's family, your family's 
probably the most influential one here.

00:18:26.130 --> 00:18:27.790
But you're still just a phony.

00:18:27.790 --> 00:18:31.540
H-How rude, you upstart!

00:18:31.860 --> 00:18:34.190
Yeah, that's right. I'm an upstart.

00:18:34.190 --> 00:18:38.050
But I'm a true noble and 
successful adventurer.

00:18:38.050 --> 00:18:40.800
Unlike you phonies.

00:18:40.800 --> 00:18:42.180
Silence!

00:18:42.470 --> 00:18:46.440
My family presented the kingdom 
with a massive island.

00:18:46.440 --> 00:18:48.690
We're the most distinguished of families!

00:18:48.690 --> 00:18:51.740
Your forefathers certainly were real nobles.

00:18:51.740 --> 00:18:55.440
But their descendants are cowards.

00:18:56.690 --> 00:19:02.040
You were relieved when Angie 
surrendered herself, weren't you?

00:19:02.040 --> 00:19:04.950
You silently waited for the storm to pass.

00:19:05.280 --> 00:19:07.370
The dukedom is right.

00:19:07.370 --> 00:19:11.460
You have none of the guts or pride 
of the descendants of adventurers.

00:19:11.460 --> 00:19:14.960
You're just cowards clinging to the 
achievements of your forefathers.

00:19:15.280 --> 00:19:20.710
And your forefathers' achievements are about 
to be overwritten by your patheticness!

00:19:21.470 --> 00:19:27.220
Once you've embarrassed your relatives, 
you'll never stop hearing about it.

00:19:27.220 --> 00:19:29.460
That you're a disgrace to nobles.

00:19:29.460 --> 00:19:33.950
How they want nothing to do with 
cowards who flee from a fight.

00:19:36.100 --> 00:19:40.740
Is the noble's blood—the adventurer's 
blood running through your veins fake?

00:19:41.020 --> 00:19:44.240
Do you want to die pathetically, 
simply waiting for death?

00:19:45.240 --> 00:19:49.340
If you're the descendants of 
great adventurers, then fight.

00:19:54.790 --> 00:19:56.630
You must be stupid.

00:19:56.630 --> 00:20:00.310
You think you can defeat those 
monsters with that thing?

00:20:00.760 --> 00:20:05.390
Go ahead and fight with 
that thing all you want.

00:20:05.390 --> 00:20:06.370
I knew it.

00:20:06.370 --> 00:20:08.770
You said so yourself.

00:20:08.770 --> 00:20:13.140
The blood of our great forefathers 
runs through our veins.

00:20:13.780 --> 00:20:16.350
That is our weapon.

00:20:16.940 --> 00:20:18.590
Let's do this!

00:20:18.590 --> 00:20:20.780
Don't underestimate us, shithead!

00:20:20.780 --> 00:20:22.560
Once we're done with 
the dukedom, you're next!

00:20:22.560 --> 00:20:25.610
We'll destroy you!

00:20:27.030 --> 00:20:30.220
<i>I like seeing guys who 
have some self-respect.</i>

00:20:30.220 --> 00:20:32.360
Baron Bartfort.

00:20:33.320 --> 00:20:35.540
You are fantastic.

00:20:36.790 --> 00:20:39.300
Your brazen attitude...

00:20:39.740 --> 00:20:42.300
You're like an untrained dog.

00:20:42.730 --> 00:20:45.050
It's thrilling!

00:20:48.030 --> 00:20:50.270
Bartfort, we're counting on you.

00:20:50.270 --> 00:20:51.250
Yeah.

00:20:51.250 --> 00:20:53.870
Did you find the ones 
who signaled the dukedom?

00:20:53.870 --> 00:20:56.560
It was a couple of Angelica's followers.

00:20:57.240 --> 00:20:59.570
They're currently being held in the brig.

00:20:59.570 --> 00:21:01.380
Wait! This is all a misunderstanding!

00:21:01.380 --> 00:21:03.320
Please listen to us!

00:21:03.580 --> 00:21:07.570
We'll let the duke handle them later.

00:21:07.570 --> 00:21:10.830
I'm going to tear off 
that scumbag's mustache.

00:21:11.640 --> 00:21:13.080
You're strong.

00:21:13.080 --> 00:21:14.960
Yeah, I already know.

00:21:16.100 --> 00:21:17.250
Mr. Leon.

00:21:20.140 --> 00:21:21.300
Please...

00:21:23.260 --> 00:21:25.050
Please save Angie.

00:21:25.830 --> 00:21:28.510
I will. That's my job.

00:21:30.020 --> 00:21:31.250
It's time.

00:21:32.470 --> 00:21:37.490
I'll show you how we'll overturn 
our difference in strength.

00:21:42.110 --> 00:21:44.320
The power of the dukedom.

00:21:55.080 --> 00:21:57.750
<b>Trapped in a Dating Sim</b>

00:23:25.540 --> 00:23:27.660
I like those key chains sold as souvenirs.

00:23:27.660 --> 00:23:28.750
What are you talking about?

00:23:28.750 --> 00:23:31.080
I'm tempted by wooden swords, 
but they take up so much space.

00:23:31.080 --> 00:23:33.260
Wooden swords? Wait, why wooden swords?

00:23:33.260 --> 00:23:37.400
Uh, um... Next time, "What I Can Do Now."

00:23:37.400 --> 00:23:39.980
Now I'm curious! Tell me!
